// prep_reads runs no Nextflow and no container. It is a plain SLURM array (run.sbatch) of bash, awk, pigz, gzip
// and md5sum, and its resources are the #SBATCH lines at the top of run.sbatch and collect_prep.sbatch:
//   run.sbatch           -p reqp --qos=requeue --requeue, 8 CPU, 8 GB, 06:00:00 per task, array 1-10
//   collect_prep.sbatch  -p reqp --qos=requeue --requeue, 1 CPU, 1 GB, 00:30:00, afterany on the array
// This file exists so that every folder under ANALYSIS/multiomics/ has the same shape. No run passes it to
// Nextflow. The shared container cache for the pipeline arms is /rs/rs_grp_oschome/go2432/u251_multiomics/singularity.
